# React

- Server Components by default; add `"use client"` only for interactivity.
- Prefer modern React 19 patterns already used by the team; do not add `useMemo`/`useCallback` by default.
- Keep components focused; extract presentational pieces when props explode.
- Use `cn()` from `@/lib/utils` for className composition.
- Forms: validate with zod schemas from `@/lib/validation/forms`.
- Do not fetch CRM/analytics directly in components — call `@/lib/crm` and `@/lib/analytics`.
